   "Atlas/Combinatorics/BiregularIncidence.lean:5:0: The module doc-string for a file should be the first command after the imports.\nPlease, add a module doc-string before `/--\nDouble-count a finite relation whose two families of fibres have constant sizes. -/\ntheorem uniform_incidence_card {A B : Type*} [Finite A] [Finite B] (r : A → B → Prop) (a b : ℕ)\n    (ha : ∀ x : A, Nat.card { y : B // r x y } = a) (hb : ∀ y : B, Nat.card { x : A // r x y } = b) :\n    Nat.card A * a = Nat.card B * b := by\n  classical\n  let : Fintype A := Fintype.ofFinite A\n  let : Fintype B := Fintype.ofFinite B\n  let e : (Σ x : A, { y : B // r x y }) ≃ Σ y : B, { x : A // r x y } :=\n    { toFun := fun z => ⟨z.2.val, z.1, z.2.prop⟩\n      invFun := fun z => ⟨z.2.val, z.1, z.2.prop⟩\n      left_inv := fun _ => rfl\n      right_inv := fun _ => rfl }\n  have h := Nat.card_congr e\n  rw [Nat.card_sigma, Nat.card_sigma] at h\n  simp_rw [ha, hb] at h\n  simpa only [Finset.sum_const, Finset.card_univ, smul_eq_mul, Nat.card_eq_fintype_card] using h`.\n\nNote: This linter can be disabled with `set_option linter.style.header false`",
